   "parent_uuid": "5a6c932d-96e6-428a-b733-06d6534c28bb",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "body": "<p>You can order from 30 days before you fly until 3 hours before your flight. There is no charge to reserve. You pay when you collect.</p>\n<h3>How it works</h3>\n<ol><li>Choose your items and enter your flight number and date.</li><li>We set your order aside, packed and labelled.</li><li>After security, show your boarding pass at the Reserve and Collect desk inside Meridian Duty Free.</li><li>Pay and take your bag to the gate.</li></ol>\n<p>If your plans change, do nothing. We put unclaimed orders back on the shelves after 24 hours.</p>\n<h3>What you can reserve</h3>\n<p>Perfume, beauty, spirits, wine, chocolate and sunglasses. You cannot reserve tobacco.</p>\n<p><button class=\"button button--secondary\" type=\"button\" disabled=\"\">Reserve duty free<span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (not available in this demonstration)</span></button></p>"
   }
  },
