   "parent_uuid": "7d3b906d-5036-438d-98e2-0acad0aa383a",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "body": "<p>What you can buy without paying tax depends on where you are flying. Staff will check your boarding pass at the till and tell you what applies. If you are flying to the European Union, liquids bought in duty free are sealed in a security bag. Do not open it until you reach your destination.</p>"
   }
